    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1941663297519939752",
      "url": "https://x.com/Anikex55/status/1941663297519939752",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Anikex55/status/1941663297519939752",
      "text": "Gn Overtake family Today Start with @overtake_world new perspective series breakdown lets start\nPERSPECTIVE Series #1: Navigating Web3's Future with Purpose\nThe digital landscape is constantly evolving, and Web3 stands at a critical juncture. OVERTAKE, a forward-thinking product development company, sheds light on the current state of this decentralized frontier in their \"PERSPECTIVE Series #1\" essay. Published in July 2025, this insightful piece delves into OVERTAKE's core product philosophy, emphasizing a commitment to iteration, validation, and invaluable community feedback.\nThe Disconnect in Web3: Hype Versus Reality\nThe article critically examines the prevailing narrative within Web3, highlighting a stark disconnect between inflated project valuations and a surprising lack of daily active users. This imbalance, OVERTAKE suggests, stems from Web3's evolution into a speculative player-versus-player (PvP) market. In this environment, value is often derived from intricate financial engineering and zero-sum trading games, rather than genuine user-driven utility. This PvP dynamic, likened to a \"Ponzi-like\" structure, leads to a misallocation of resources, primarily generating tradable assets instead of products that resonate with users beyond the crypto bubble.\nCharting a New Path: PvP vs. PvE Crypto\nTo address this challenge and forge a more sustainable path, OVERTAKE introduces a crucial framework: categorizing Web3 projects into Player-vs-Player (PvP) and Player-vs-Environment (PvE).\n * PvP Crypto: Characterized by closed-loop, zero-sum value creation, PvP crypto largely involves the redistribution of value among existing crypto participants.\n * PvE Crypto: In contrast, PvE crypto champions open value creation. It seeks to engage with the broader world of users, businesses, and traditional economies, delivering tangible products or services. Success in this realm is measured by authentic usage growth and real-world impact.\nThe Future is PvE: Real Growth Through Utility\nOVERTAKE firmly believes that the true and lasting growth of Web3 will emerge from PvE dynamics. This growth is anticipated through two primary avenues:\n * Embedding Crypto Primitives in the Real World: This involves integrating foundational crypto technologies into existing real-world solutions. Examples include utilizing stablecoins for efficient cross-border payments or the tokenization of real-world assets (RWA) like U.S. Treasuries. Such applications introduce new value and attract a wider user base by directly addressing real-world problems.\n * Application-Driven Web3 Products: These products prioritize utility over mere token incentives to attract users. While early examples like Axie Infinity, despite their imperfections, demonstrated the potential for mass user adoption, the focus is now on creating genuinely useful and engaging applications.\nOVERTAKE's Vision: Building for Long-Term Value\nAt its core, OVERTAKE's strategy is defined by discipline, rapid shipping, hypothesis testing, and an unwavering focus on delivering long-term value through robust execution. Their initial foray into peer-to-peer game commerce exemplifies this approach. The goal is to craft seamless experiences, enabling a user in Manila to effortlessly sell a rare digital skin to a collector in New York, without overtly highlighting the underlying crypto infrastructure.\nThe article concludes with a powerful message: the next wave of Web3 adoption will not be driven by clever financial engineering alone. Instead, it will be catalyzed by products that unlock novel value by seamlessly embedding crypto within existing services or by pioneering entirely new behaviors from the ground up. This perspective underscores a shift towards utility-driven innovation as the true engine of Web3's widespread acceptance and success.\n@overtake_world\n$TAKE",
